  "item_short_desc": "<p>Experience superior quality and top-notch performance with our 10-Inch Speedlace Combat Boots. Constructed with a durable leather upper and padded leather collar, the military combat boots provide the best in comfort while offering outstanding protection during intensive training and rugged outdoor use.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "8160",
  "description": "<p>Experience superior quality and top-notch performance with our 10-Inch Speedlace Combat Boots. Constructed with a durable leather upper and padded leather collar, the military combat boots provide the best in comfort while offering outstanding protection during intensive training and rugged outdoor use. Rapid Response: These military boots come equipped with Rothco&rsquo;s nylon-coated brass speedhook and eyelet lacing system, featuring 6 speed hooks and 2 lower eyelets, for quick, efficient, and secure tying. Enhanced Grip: Navigate any terrain confidently with a vulcanized rubber outsole for extra traction that supports quick and sharp movements during field missions, outdoor training sessions, or everyday life. Long-Lasting Support: The tactical speedlace boot features a 10-inch height and reinforced seams for dependable durability and ankle support. The internal steel stank helps reduce stain on your heel and calf while providing additional stability and support. Enduring Comfort: These military uniform boots utilize a padded collar and a removable cushion insole for providing all-day comfort while on duty or off duty. These tactical combat boots are designed for military personnel, tactical professionals, and outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
